Declare the extension required by GH-17469 so PHP's test runner skips it when
intl is unavailable. Backport only this test's metadata from:
https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/191290e19

Remove this patch when the selected PHP release includes that declaration.

--- a/ext/intl/tests/gh17469.phpt
+++ b/ext/intl/tests/gh17469.phpt
@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@
 --TEST--
 GH-17469: UConverter::transcode() raises always E_WARNING regardless of INI settings
+--EXTENSIONS--
+intl
 --SKIPIF--
 <?php
 if (PHP_OS_FAMILY === "Windows") die("skip currently unsupported on Windows");
